---
name: Normalize Live Claude Code OTLP
description: >
  Reads 100 live events from the `otlp` topic and prints security- and
  governance-relevant Claude Code activity as OCSF.
---

subscribe "otlp"
anthropic::claude_code::ocsf
where class_uid != 0
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
head 100
to_stdout {
  write_ndjson
}
